Project Overview
This public-safe version documents a Google Apps Script dashboard automation project that pulls data from Shopify, Meta Ads, and Google Ads into Google Sheets.

Current Status
- Shopify: Connected for Brand 1 AU and NZ
- Meta Ads: Connected for Brand 1 AU and NZ
- Google Ads: Connected for Brand 1 AU and NZ
- Brand 2 and Brand 3: Pending credentials

Privacy Notes
- All live tokens, IDs, and sensitive client values were replaced with placeholders.
- Brand names were anonymized for portfolio use.
- This file is intended for GitHub portfolio presentation only.
